WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.934
- Good afternoon.

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:03.047
With the holiday season fast approaching,

00:00:03.047 --> 00:00:04.138
we wanted to take a moment

00:00:04.138 --> 00:00:05.485
to address some online threats

00:00:05.485 --> 00:00:06.645
that could make the internet

00:00:06.645 --> 00:00:09.335
an unsafe place as the
year draws to a close.

00:00:09.335 --> 00:00:10.728
- For most of us the holidays

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:12.350
mean spending time with family.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:13.251
So it's important then

00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:14.970
that families know what they should post

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:15.779
on our Facebook.

00:00:15.779 --> 00:00:16.936
- [Justin] Nothing.
- [Zack] Nothing.

00:00:16.936 --> 00:00:20.509
("Return To You")

00:00:20.509 --> 00:00:21.647
- Under no circumstances

00:00:21.647 --> 00:00:22.854
should you post anything

00:00:22.854 --> 00:00:24.356
to our Facebook, families.

00:00:24.356 --> 00:00:26.538
- Uncle Roy, I'm not politically active,

00:00:26.538 --> 00:00:28.001
especially not on Facebook,

00:00:28.001 --> 00:00:29.650
and especially not for you know who.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.798
- And Mom, I know that's
a cute picture of me,

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:32.730
that's why I posted it.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.448
You don't need to remind all my friends.

00:00:34.448 --> 00:00:36.421
- Aunt Carol, I promise I have seen

00:00:36.421 --> 00:00:38.604
every single baby hippo video.

00:00:38.604 --> 00:00:39.277
Seriously.

00:00:39.277 --> 00:00:40.763
So much it would destroy you.

00:00:40.763 --> 00:00:42.851
- Kurt, I know you're my cousin and all,

00:00:42.851 --> 00:00:44.664
but please stop hitting on my friends.

00:00:44.664 --> 00:00:46.800
They're not going to be sure to chill

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.845
when you visit.

00:00:47.845 --> 00:00:48.960
Y'all have my number.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.004
- And you have my email.

00:00:50.004 --> 00:00:51.862
- Maybe send it just to me.

00:00:51.862 --> 00:00:53.185
- It's not that I'm embarrassed.

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:54.268
It's like-

00:00:54.268 --> 00:00:55.535
- It's just sometimes,

00:00:55.535 --> 00:00:56.668
I'd rather-

00:00:56.668 --> 00:00:57.527
- Keep it in the family.

00:00:57.527 --> 00:00:58.270
- Exactly.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.571
Keep it in the family.

00:00:59.571 --> 00:01:01.126
- Which is why we're starting the hashtag,

00:01:01.126 --> 00:01:02.752
hashtag keep it in the family.

00:01:02.752 --> 00:01:03.839
- So help your family out.

00:01:03.839 --> 00:01:05.163
When they something,

00:01:05.163 --> 00:01:07.508
and I mean anything on your Facebook,

00:01:07.508 --> 00:01:08.599
gently remind them-

00:01:08.599 --> 00:01:09.899
- Hashtag keep it in the family.

00:01:09.899 --> 00:01:11.525
- And together we can have a safe-

00:01:11.525 --> 00:01:12.477
- And private-

00:01:12.477 --> 00:01:13.661
- Holiday season.

00:01:13.661 --> 00:01:14.331
Thank you.

00:01:14.331 --> 00:01:18.482
("Return To You")

